sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant APIServer as batch-gateway-apiserver<br/>REST API<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>TCP
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>TCP
    participant Processor as batch-gateway-processor<br/>Background Worker
    participant LLMd as llm-d Inference Gateway<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GC as batch-gateway-gc<br/>Background Worker
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over Client,OTel: Batch Job Submission Flow

    Client->>APIServer: POST /v1/batch (Create Job)<br/>No App-Level Auth<br/>Platform-Delegated AuthN
    activate APIServer
    APIServer->>APIServer: Middleware: Panic Recovery,<br/>Request ID, Tenant Context,<br/>Metrics, Security Headers
    APIServer->>PG: Store job metadata<br/>pgx driver + connection pool
    PG-->>APIServer: Job ID
    APIServer->>S3: Upload input files<br/>AWS SDK v2
    S3-->>APIServer: Upload confirmation
    APIServer->>Redis: Publish async task<br/>llm-d-async producer
    Redis-->>APIServer: Task queued
    APIServer->>OTel: Export trace spans<br/>OTLP/gRPC
    APIServer-->>Client: 200 OK (Job ID)
    deactivate APIServer

    Note over Processor,LLMd: Inference Dispatch Flow

    loop Poll for pending tasks
        Processor->>Redis: Consume pending tasks<br/>llm-d-async consumer
        Redis-->>Processor: Task payload
        activate Processor
        Processor->>S3: Fetch input data
        S3-->>Processor: Input file contents
        Processor->>LLMd: POST inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        LLMd-->>Processor: Inference result
        Processor->>S3: Write output results
        S3-->>Processor: Write confirmation
        Processor->>PG: Update job state<br/>(completed/failed)
        PG-->>Processor: Update confirmed
        Processor->>OTel: Export trace spans<br/>OTLP/gRPC
        deactivate Processor
    end

    Note over GC,S3: Garbage Collection Flow

    loop Periodic scan
        GC->>PG: Scan for expired jobs
        PG-->>GC: Expired job list
        activate GC
        GC->>S3: Remove expired files
        S3-->>GC: Deletion confirmed
        GC->>PG: Remove expired job records
        PG-->>GC: Deletion confirmed
        GC->>OTel: Export trace spans<br/>OTLP/gRPC
        deactivate GC
    end

    Note over Client,APIServer: Job Query Flow

    Client->>APIServer: GET /v1/batch/{id} (Get Job)
    activate APIServer
    APIServer->>PG: Query job status
    PG-->>APIServer: Job details
    APIServer-->>Client: 200 OK (Job Status + Results)
    deactivate APIServer

    Client->>APIServer: DELETE /v1/batch/{id} (Delete Job)
    activate APIServer
    APIServer->>PG: Mark job for deletion
    PG-->>APIServer: Deletion confirmed
    APIServer-->>Client: 200 OK
    deactivate APIServer
